    "description": "Postman collection for testing Question Set Full CRUD (Module 1, Step 4) and Sessions & Joining (Module 2).\n\nSeeded accounts used:\n- host: school_id 2099-0001 (Host Account, HOST role)\n- otherHost: school_id 2099-0003 (Second Host, HOST role)\n- player: school_id 2099-1001 (Alice Player, PLAYER role)\n\nCollection variables:\n- baseUrl: http://localhost:3001/api/v1\n- host, otherHost, player: school_id values for X-Demo-User header\n- setId: captured from the create question-set response, reused across subsequent cases\n- sessionCode: captured from the create session response, reused across session cases\n- playerId, playerScore: captured from the first join, reused to verify rejoin",
